r-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"The goal is predictable document handling. Users should know which file goes in, what transformation happens, how to verify the result, and when a browser tool is enough versus when a full editor is required."}],"$Ld"]}]]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"]}]}]]
